# ============================================================================
# STM32MLPipeline .gitignore
# ============================================================================
# Strategy: reproducible builds. Track everything needed for someone else
# (or another machine) to clone the repo and build. This includes binary
# library files, HAL drivers, and Eclipse project descriptors that lock
# the build to a known configuration.
#
# Only ignore: workspace history, build outputs, IDE user-settings, OS junk.
# ============================================================================

# ----- Build outputs (regenerated by every build) -----
Debug/
Release/
build/
*.o
*.obj
*.ko
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
*.list
*.lst
*.su
*.cyclo
*.d
*.i*86
*.x86_64
default.size.stdout

# ----- Linker intermediates -----
*.ilk
*.exp
*.gch
*.pch

# ----- Debug intermediates (NOT debug-info files we ship) -----
*.dSYM/
*.idb
*.pdb
*.dwo

# ----- Backup / temp -----
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.tmp
*.tmp_versions/

# ----- AI Studio workspace (large, regenerable, machine-specific paths) -----
# .ai/ contains AI Studio's internal run history, validation runs,
# compile workspaces. The relevant outputs are copied into AI/App/ and
# Middlewares/ which ARE tracked.
.ai/
.stm32cubeaistudio/

# ----- IDE user-settings (machine-specific, not project structure) -----
# Note: .cproject and .project ARE tracked (project structure)
# Only the user-personal settings are ignored.
.metadata/
.settings/
*.launch
RemoteSystemsTempFiles/
.recommenders/
.vscode/.history/
# Rewritten automatically by the VS Code Python Environments extension.
.vscode/settings.json

# ----- Python -----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ----- Shared libraries / DLLs / executables (NOT static .a) -----
# .a files (static libraries) ARE tracked - they pin the ST AI runtime
# and are part of the artifact contract.
*.dll
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# ----- Kernel module artifacts -----
*.mod*
*.cmd
modules.order
Module.symvers
Mkfile.old
dkms.conf

# ----- OS detritus -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================================================
# Explicitly NOT ignored (worth listing so future-you knows the intent):
#
#   *.a                                      ST AI runtime library (binary,
#                                            but version-locked artifact)
#   Middlewares/ST/AI/Lib/*.a                Same.
#   Middlewares/ST/AI/Inc/*.h                Runtime headers.
#   Drivers/                                 STM32 HAL drivers (version-locked,
#                                            needed for build).
#   .cproject, .project                      Eclipse project descriptors
#                                            (needed for CubeIDE import).
#   *.ioc                                    CubeMX configuration.
#   *.ld                                     Linker scripts (hand-edited).
#   AI/App/network*.c,h                      Generated network source compiled
#                                            into firmware.
#   outputs/*.tflite, *.h5, *.keras          Model artifacts.
#   test_vectors.json, model_weights.json    Reference data.
# ============================================================================